1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
A lot of people think that these are the best wraps in New York City.

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:06,160
Let's watch the Diary Wolf Wrap get made at Wolf Nights in the West Village.

3
00:00:06,799 --> 00:00:12,419
Housemade ginger dough gets pressed and baked on a hot iron dome, some mixed greens, their signature wolf ketchup,

4
00:00:12,679 --> 00:00:19,199
papaya slaw, spicy pickled peppers, fried chicken, lamb bacon, on goes some melted cheddar cheese,

5
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,260
and another drizzle of that wolf ketchup.

6
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:26,660
It gets wrapped up nice and tight, and there you have it.

7
00:00:27,859 --> 00:00:31,399
This is one of their most popular wraps, and we've been devouring it for years.

8
00:00:31,699 --> 00:00:32,340
Have you been here yet?

